accTitle: "NutsNews iOS Feature 7 — Daily Digest / Today’s Picks"
accDescr: "Adds a native **Today’s Picks** screen to the hamburger menu."
flowchart TD
  A[Open app feed] --> B[Open hamburger menu]
  B --> C[Tap Today’s Picks]
  C --> D[Load currently loaded feed]
  D --> E[Build digest summary (story/source/saved counts)]
  E --> F[Select daily featured story]
  F --> G[Show quick-read and worth-saving cards]
  G --> H[Render additional digest rows]
  H --> I[Tap Open story]
  I --> J[Open article detail]
  J --> K[Save from digest if desired]

